        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="notes" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:25px;line-height:119%;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;No record is declared safe just because a regex did not match.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding-top:10px;font-size:23px;line-height:122%;&quot;&gt;The fast path emits only approved fields and discards other text. To retain arbitrary free text, run it through Presidio too. Raw copies go to the restricted forensic archive before redaction. Normal Grafana&lt;br&gt;never queries that archive.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#fbbf24;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=25;fontColor=#142e50;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
